          "snippet": {
            "line": 237,
            "text": "theorem reconstructed_flux_derivative {S : Set ℝ} {h : ℝ} (d : Domain S h)\n    (lam : ℝ) (u : EvenProfile S) {R eta : ℝ} (heta : eta ∈ S) :\n    HasDerivAt (fun r => r ^ 2 / 2 * betaFromU d lam u (r, eta))\n      (-R * PositiveOrderMoments.radialZ h (-PositiveAxisSystem.a h + lam) u (R, eta)) R"
          }
